  The fixed-volume explanation now gives the Cauchy argument and the
  full-spacing upgrade; the underlying analytic estimates remain inputs in
  III.12 and IV.1. The assembly outline still records an incomplete reading
  of this upgrade. These links locate the argument without claiming that all
  its estimates have been independently explained.

  <subsection|Data shared by the four conclusions:
  H1\UH8><label|data-shared-by-the-four-conclusions-h1h8>

  These are the objects whose existence is required, not additional
  assertions about their physical interpretation. The definitions below and
  the <hlink|assembly|outline/units/VIII-1.tm#1-what-this-unit-proves> fix
  how the same objects occur in all four conclusions.

