  <\itemize-dot>
    <item>[Assessment] Yang\UMills group, <hlink|<em|Validation of the OpenAI
    Yang\UMills construction>|https://github.com/yang-mills-group/YM/blob/55ba9fc36293b3f4d52c6b1f813169a0be76ee98/docs/assessment-1.pdf>,
    document dated 10 November 2026, published with the source on 11 November
    2026. The link fixes assessment repository revision <verbatim|55ba9fc>.

    <item>[DMY] M. R. Douglas, Y. Mei, X. Yin, formalization of the
    Osterwalder\USchrader axioms and reconstruction
    (<hlink|repository|https://github.com/xiyin137/OSreconstruction>).

    <item>[JW] A. Jaffe and E. Witten, <em|Quantum Yang\UMills theory>, in
    <em|The Millennium Prize Problems>, Clay Math. Inst. and AMS, 2006.

    <item>[OS] K. Osterwalder and R. Schrader, Axioms for Euclidean Green's
    functions I, II, Comm. Math. Phys. 31 (1973) 83\U112; 42 (1975) 281\U305.

    <item>[SW] R. F. Streater and A. S. Wightman, <em|PCT, Spin and
    Statistics, and All That>, Benjamin, 1964.
  </itemize-dot>

